graph TD
    subgraph Client Layer
        Web[React 19 + TypeScript SPA]
        Ext[Chrome Extension Manifest V3]
    end

    subgraph API & Gateway
        Server[Express / FastAPI API Gateway]
        Auth[JWT & Bcrypt Security Middleware]
        SSRF[SSRF Validator & DNS Filter]
    end

    subgraph Core Processing Pipeline
        Scraper[Clean HTML Article Extractor]
        OCR[Gemini 3.8 Flash Vision OCR]
        Lang[Multilingual NLP & Language Detector]
        Claim[Claim Isolation & Factual Extractor]
    end

    subgraph RAG & Verification Engine
        Grounding[Google Search Live Grounding]
        Stance[Stance Detection SUPPORTS/CONTRADICTS]
        Scorer[Multi-Factor Credibility Scoring Engine]
        XAI[Explainable AI XAI Synthesizer]
    end

    subgraph Storage & Persistence
        DB[(PostgreSQL / ACID JSON Store)]
        SourceRep[(Source Reputation Registry)]
        Audit[(Audit & Security Logs)]
    end

    Web -->|HTTP / REST| Server
    Ext -->|Background Fetch| Server

    Server --> Auth
    Server --> SSRF
    SSRF --> Scraper

    Server --> OCR
    Server --> Lang
    Lang --> Claim

    Claim --> Grounding
    Grounding --> Stance
    Stance --> Scorer
    SourceRep --> Scorer
    Scorer --> XAI

    XAI --> DB
    Server --> DB
    Auth --> Audit
